WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
An analyst opens the reconciliation desk and loads a statement with two transfers.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.200
Reconciliation flags a BRL 17.50 difference on transfer REP-1048.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.400
The analyst opens the entry and explains the confirmed fee.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.640
The entry is marked as reviewed. The audit trail preserves the explanation.
